00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.960
This video describes how to prepare the child and mother, or care, before performing the fund-red

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.840
reflex tests in both newborns and older children.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.720
The child should be held securely, yet comfortably,

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.524
either on the lap over a shoulder, or if baby lying on their back.

5
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:23.840
It is important for them to feel safe.

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.640
Young babies can be restless and may need to be swaddled.

7
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:35.600
Examining shortly after a feed can help as they will be relaxed and a little sleepy.

8
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.800
All our children may settle by playing with a toy for a short while.

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.560
Speak with a friendly tone and try to get down to their eyes level.

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.080
Explain what you are going to do and gain concept before you start.

11
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.493
First, ask the mother or care if they have not any wrong with their

12
00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:59.040
child's eye or vision

13
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.880
and how long they have not the problem.

14
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.720
Next, look at the child's face and eyes.

15
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.336
Ask yourself some questions.

16
00:01:06.336 --> 00:01:11.184
Does the child seem to have pain in one or both eyes?

17
00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:12.800
Are the eyes open

18
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.488
or are they keeping them tightly shut?

19
00:01:15.488 --> 00:01:18.560
Is there watering or discharge from the eyes?

20
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.440
Are the eyes the same size?

21
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.000
Are the eyelids swollen?

22
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.040
Now, consider how the child is seeing.

23
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:31.040
Move your face slowly from side to side, watching the eyes.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.880
Make some silent smile.

25
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.040
Does the child follow the movement of your face?

26
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.840
Or respond to your silent smile?

27
00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.040
Again ask yourself some questions.

28
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.440
Do both eyes move freely and together?

29
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:51.040
Are the eyes straight, or is one eye turning inwards or outwards?

30
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.670
Do the eyes wobble?

31
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.866
You can also use the flashlights on the arclights and the pictures of the

32
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:01.350
bed to gain attention

33
00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.590
and assess the quality of vision.

34
00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:08.230
Move the target side to side up and down.

35
00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.470
Look to see if the child is fixing and following the targets.

36
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:17.790
When they reach and point accurately at the

37
00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:22.110
target, often only one eye cannot see well.

38
00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:26.830
You or mother can cover one eye, then the other.

39
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.784
Move the target and compare how the child behaves to when using both eyes,

40
00:02:32.784 --> 00:02:34.910
then one at a time.

41
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:40.323
If the child does not like one eye being covered, it suggests the uncovered

42
00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.870
eye does not see

43
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.870
so well.

44
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:48.602
If you think you can see something wrong with the external eye, look more

45
00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:49.830
closely using the

46
00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.870
loop end of the atlight.

47
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:58.310
Switch the lights on and move up close to around 6 cm.

48
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:04.390
You may need to use your finger to gently open the eyelids.

49
00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.390
Ask yourself some questions.

50
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:12.470
Is the white part of the eye pink already?

51
00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:19.670
This pupil or cornea gray or white is the pupil round.

52
00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.190
Can you see any foreign bodies?

53
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.550
Now you are ready to perform the reflex test.
